ook":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","start":1979,"end":1995,"desc":"La población universitaria del Sur adopta la ética de la new wave y la adapta a la melodía: un pop inusualmente intelectual, con raíces en el folk-rock y el country-rock pero contaminado por las neurosis de la época. Athens (Georgia) compite con las capitales del rock: B-52's y R.E.M., uno de los grupos de más éxito de la historia. Carolina del Norte (dB's, Windbreakers), Hoboken (Smithereens, Bongos, Tiny Lights), el nacimiento del lo-fi (Half Japanese, Violent Femmes, Beat Happening, Guided By Voices, Sebadoh), They Might Be Giants, Green, B.A.L.L., Boston (Volcano Suns, 10,000 Maniacs, Throwing Muses, Blake Babies), la Costa Oeste (Game Theory, Posies, Young Fresh Fellows) y la sátira de Ween.","color":"#f472b6","family":"Pop, power-pop y synth-pop","link":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/#college-pop"}],"book_tracks":[{"id":256652949532422,"artist":"Smithereens","artist_id":94937981388481,"title":"Especially For You","year":1986,"ess":1,"yt":"gWX3-96H3C0","kind":"a","book":{"id":8,"title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","url":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/"},"scene":"College-pop y nacimiento del lo-fi","scene_id":243752875478949,"scene_link":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/#college-pop","chapters":["Sección 5.10"],"pages":[[1,150,null]]},{"id":81333316541399,"artist":"Smithereens","artist_id":94937981388481,"title":"Green Thoughts","year":1988,"ess":0,"yt":"ZOkna9IwH8k","kind":"a","book":{"id":8,"title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","url":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/"},"scene":"College-pop y nacimiento del lo-fi","scene_id":243752875478949,"scene_link":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/#college-pop","chapters":["Sección 5.10"],"pages":[[1,150,null]]},{"id":159578974706550,"artist":"Smithereens","artist_id":94937981388481,"title":"A Girl Like You","year":1989,"ess":0,"yt":